5f5f5;color:#333;}\nheader{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding:10px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;}\nnav a{margin:0 10px;text-decoration:none;color:#555;}\nnav a:hover{color:#000;}\nsection{padding:20px;}\nh1{font-size:2em;margin-bottom:0.5em;}\nh2{font-size:1.5em;margin-top:1.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em;}\ntable{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:10px;}\nth,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:8px;text-align:left;}\nth{background:#e6d8c9;}\n@media (max-width:600px){\nh1{font-size:1.8em;}\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n<div>家味餐厅</div>\n<nav>\n<a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n<a href=\"menu.html\">菜单</a>\n<a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n<a href=\"reservation.html\">预订</a>\n</nav>\n</header>\n<section>\n<h1>菜单</h1>\n<h2>主菜</h2>\n<table>\n<tr><th>菜名</th><th>价格（元）</th></tr>\n<tr><td>东坡肉</td><td>38</td></tr>\n<tr><td>叫化鸡</td><td>45</td></tr>\n<tr><td>西湖醋鱼</td><td>48</td></tr>\n<tr><td>葱烧海参</td><td>58</td></tr>\n<tr><td>椒盐排骨</td><td>32</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h2>小吃</h2>\n<table>\n<tr><th>菜名</th><th>价格（元）</th></tr>\n<tr><td>桂花糖藕</td><td>18</td></tr>\n<tr><td>葱油饼</td><td>12</td></tr>\n<tr><td>腊味合蒸</td><td>22</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h2>甜点</h2>\n<table>\n<tr><th>菜名</th><th>价格（元）</th></tr>\n<tr><td>绿豆汤</td><td>8</td></tr>\n<tr><td>西米露</td><td>12</td></tr>\n<tr><td>桂圆红枣茶</td><td>10</td></tr>\n</table>\n</section>\n<footer style=\"text-align:center;padding:10px 0;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #ddd;color:#777;\">© 2024 家味餐厅 All Rights Reserved</footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: about.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>关于家味餐厅</title>\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\nbody{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f5f5;color:#333;}\nheader{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding:10px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;}\nnav a{margin:0 10px;text-decoration:none;color:#555;}\nnav a:hover{color:#000;}\nsection{padding:20px;}\nh1{font-size:2em;margin-bottom:0.5em;}\np{line-height:1.6;}\n@media (max-width:600px){\nh1{font-size:1.8em;}\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n<div>家味餐厅</div>\n<nav>\n<a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n<a href=\"menu.html\">菜单</a>\n<a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n<a href=\"reservation.html\">预订</a>\n</nav>\n</header>\n<section>\n<h1>关于我们</h1>\n<p>家味餐厅创立于2010年，始于一位热爱传统浙江菜的厨师与其家族。我们坚持使用本地新鲜食材，结合家传烹饪技艺，力求让每一道菜都能让客人感受到“家”的温暖。</p>\n<p>餐厅位于杭州市西湖区翠苑路，环境优雅，座位宽敞，既适合家庭聚餐，也适合商务洽谈。我们的目标是为每一位客人提供舒适的就餐体验与贴心的服务。</p>\n<p>在这里，您可以品尝到经典的东坡肉、叫化鸡等正宗浙江菜，也可以尝试我们的特色甜点和手工小吃。无论是日常聚餐还是特别场合，家味餐厅都愿意成为您的首选。</p>\n</section>\n<footer style=\"text-align:center;padding:10px 0;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #ddd;color:#777;\">© 2024 家味餐厅 All Rights Reserved</footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: reservation.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>预订座位 - 家味餐厅</title>\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\nbody{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f5f5;color:#333;}\nheader{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding:10px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;}\nnav a{margin:0 10px;text-decoration:none;color:#555;}\nnav a:hover{color:#000;}\nsection{padding:20px;}\nh1{font-size:2em;margin-bottom:0.5em;}\nform{max-width:500px;margin:auto;background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}\nlabel{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-weight:bold;}\ninput,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:8px;margin-top:5px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:4px;}\nbutton{margin-top:15px;padding:10px 20px;background:#e6d8c9;border:none;border-radius:4px;color:#333;font-size:1em;cursor:pointer;}\nbutton:hover{background:#d5c7a8;}\n@media (max-width:600px){\nh1{font-size:1.8em;}\n}\n</style>\n<script>\nfunction validateForm(){\nvar name=document.getElementById('name').value;\nvar phone=document.getElementById('phone').value;\nvar date=document.getElementById('date').value;\nvar time=document.getElementById('time').value;\nvar people=document.getElementById('people').value;\nif(!name||!phone||!date||!time||!people){\nalert('请完整填写所有必填字段。');\nreturn false;\n}\nalert('预订成功！我们将尽快与您确认。');\nreturn false; // 阻止表单真正提交\n}\n</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n<div>家味餐厅</div>\n<nav>\n<a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n<a href=\"menu.html\">菜单</a>\n<a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n<a href=\"reservation.html\">预订</a>\n</nav>\n</header>\n<section>\n<h1>预订座位</h1>\n<form onsubmit=\"return validateForm();\">\n<label for=\"name\">姓名（必填）</label>\n<input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" required>\n<label for=\"phone\">联系电话（必填）</label>\n<input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" required>\n<label for=\"date\">预订日期（必填）</label>\n<input type=\"date\" id=\"date\" name=\"date\" required>\n<label for=\"time\">预订时间（必填）</label>\n<input type=\"time\" id=\"time\" name=\"time\" required>\n<label for=\"people\">人数（必填）</label>\n<input type=\"number\" id=\"people\" name=\"people\" min=\"1\" required>\n<label for=\"note\">备注</label>\n<textarea id=\"note\" name=\"note\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n<button type=\"submit\">提交预订</button>\n</form>\n</section>\n<footer style=\"text-align:center;padding:10px 0;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #ddd;color:#777;\">© 2024 家味餐厅 All Rights Reserved</footer>\n</body>\n</html>"
